<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    The themed-icon layer (Android 13+), where the system discards these
    colours and tints the alpha channel a single wallpaper-derived one.

    Its own file rather than a reuse of the foreground, because the two have
    different jobs: the foreground can rely on colour to separate the core from
    the rings, and this cannot. Everything here is therefore a stroke or a small
    solid, weighted a little heavier so the mark survives being flattened to one
    tone at launcher size.
-->
